intel-crashlog (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
    - intel-crashlog: the iclg command line tool, its manual pages and shell
      completions.
    - libintel-crashlog1 and libintel-crashlog-dev: the shared library, the
      generated C and C++ headers and the pkg-config file.
    - intel-crashlog-efi: the UEFI application, built when the
      pkg.intel-crashlog.efi build profile is enabled.
  * Build the Rust dependencies from the vendored sources shipped in the
    vendor component of the upstream tarball, so that the build works offline.

 -- Intel Corporation <crashlog@intel.com>  Fri, 14 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0300
